    "text": "coyote105.com\nwebsite\nMccook\nMCC golfers in Wyoming for first fall meet\n1 days ago\nThe McCook Community College golf team opens the 2025-2026 season Thursday and Friday at the Cottonwood Golf Course in Torrington, Wyo. Second year MCC Coach Grant Case, will lead a team of two sophomores and five freshmen this season. Last year the Indians finished sixth among seven teams in the season-ending West Region Championships at Loveland, Colo.",
